    ok     429 carries a usable Retry-After, got 60

  the admin's own provider call is not a way round it
    ok     verify is refused while the window is full, got 429

  restored: 20/min, 200000 tokens/day
  spent today: 0 tokens (unchanged by this script)

  Limits are enforced, defaults cover a missing or invalid value, and the
  admin verify path spends from the same budget.

  The per-minute window clears 60s after the last request.


