  ok    established + low = 99213                                 
  ok    99201 is absent — deleted in the 2021 revision            

  time bands, at their boundaries
  ok    new: 15–29 → straightforward                              99202 / 99202
  ok    new: 30–44 → low                                          99203 / 99203
  ok    new: 45–59 → moderate                                     99204 / 99204
  ok    new: 60–74 → high                                         99205 / 99205
  ok    established: 10–19 → straightforward                      99212 / 99212
  ok    established: 20–29 → low                                  99213 / 99213
  ok    established: 30–39 → moderate                             99214 / 99214
  ok    established: 40–54 → high                                 99215 / 99215
  ok    under the lowest band supports no level                   14 min → null
  ok    a non-number supports no level                            

  Two of three is the median, a single element cannot carry a visit,
  and the time bands hold at their boundaries.


